      617            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      618            TITLE "Весы с товаром"
      619            CANCEL-BUTTON b-quit.
      620   ASSIGN
      621          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      622          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      623   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
